---

const heading = {
  title: `骨董品・古美術品
無料で鑑定いたします
スマホで、かんたん査定`,
  description: `開豊ジャパンは、八王子市の古美術品店
確かな目利きと、多数の高価買取実績あり

眠ったままの骨董品、思いの詰まった遺品など、
１点１点しっかり丁寧に鑑定します。

どんなお品物でも高価買取、
LINEやチャットで、スピーディに鑑定・買取!!`
};
---

<section class="hero min-h-screen bg-flash pt-12 pb-20">
  <div class="hero-content flex-col-reverse md:flex-row-reverse text-center md:text-left max-w-4xl">
    
    <!-- Text Content -->
    <div class="flex-1">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-primary mb-8 whitespace-pre-wrap">
        {heading.title}
      </h2>
      
      <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center md:justify-start mb-8">
        <a href="/assessments/line" class="btn btn-primary">
          査定をはじめる
        </a>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-outline" id="chat-button">
          チャットで相談
        </button>
      </div>
      
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-wrap">
        {heading.description}
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Image Content -->
    <div class="flex-1 relative mb-12 md:mb-0 overflow-hidden">
      <img 
        src="/items/other.webp" 
        width="350" 
        height="350" 
        alt="antique item" 
        class="absolute bottom-[30px] animate-fade-in"
        loading="eager"
      />

      <div class="relative transform-origin-bottom-left animate-slide-in-right">
        <div class="flex gap-2 absolute top-24 w-full justify-center opacity-80">
          <img src="/badges/1.webp" width="65" height="65" alt="badge1" />
          <img src="/badges/2.webp" width="65" height="65" alt="badge2" />
          <img src="/badges/3.webp" width="65" height="65" alt="badge3" />
        </div>
        <img 
          src="/home/phone_frame.webp" 
          width="350" 
          height="539" 
          alt="smart phone frame"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const chatButton = document.getElementById('chat-button');
    chatButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      // Open Crisp chat if available
      if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.Crisp) {
        window.Crisp.chat.open();
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  @keyframes fade-in {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to { opacity: 1; }
  }
  
  @keyframes slide-in-right {
    from { 
      transform: rotate(90deg); 
      opacity: 0;
    }
    to { 
      transform: rotate(0deg); 
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }
  
  .animate-fade-in {
    animation: fade-in 1s ease-in-out;
  }
  
  .animate-slide-in-right {
    animation: slide-in-right 0.8s ease-in-out;
  }
</style>